  "name": "Pedestrian emerges from adjacent-lane stopped vehicle",
  "description": "A stopped vehicle in the neighboring same-direction lane conceals a pedestrian who walks out into the ego lane shortly before the ego reaches the crossing line. The pedestrian is timed as a moving challenger rather than spawned as a static obstacle, preserving a hidden, urgent but survivable encounter across retargeted sites.",
